		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Legendary Plate Armor</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> 2,000,000 g</p><p><em>The intoxicating power of dread still churns within the blackened armor of a long-deposed king.</em></p><hr><p><strong>20 Armor</strong> (Req. 4 STR).</p><p>When rolling Initiative, all enemies within Reach 4 must make a WIL save (DC 10+KEY). On fail, they become Frightened for 1 minute or until damaged. If they fail by 5 or more, they also become Incapacitated for 1 turn.</p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; Can Opener, Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
